WEBVTT

00:00:05.810 --> 00:00:08.270
Day duty

00:00:05.810 --> 00:00:08.270
Yayoi

00:00:05.810 --> 00:00:08.270
Karin

00:00:06.580 --> 00:00:10.280
Everyone, the repairs at the training 
grounds are all finished now.

00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:12.900
Starting tomorrow you'll be 
able to use them freely again.

00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:15.700
That means we can have our 
practical exam, doesn't it?

00:00:16.150 --> 00:00:19.300
Yayoi-san, while I'd like to give 
you a gold star for your dedication,

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:20.560
I'm sorry.

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:23.220
Next week's the closing 
ceremony, so I'm afraid not.

00:00:23.710 --> 00:00:25.540
That really is a disappointment.

00:00:25.540 --> 00:00:28.230
We're way better off 
without that test anyway.

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:32.900
Mahiro-san! The practical exam 
only comes but twice a year!

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:32.900
Yayoi.

00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:33.720
So you had better—

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:36.220
Homeroom isn't over yet.

00:00:36.220 --> 00:00:38.390
Pardon me.

00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:42.760
I also have news about
the New Year's incident.

00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:46.100
Since all of you were involved,
I'll say it here.

00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:47.000
Lion.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:48.430
Yes.

00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:50.170
Nina.

00:00:50.170 --> 00:00:51.030
Yes.

00:00:51.870 --> 00:00:53.830
You two will not be punished 
for what happened.

00:00:56.720 --> 00:00:59.870
However, Lion, you will have to participate 
in supplementary lessons for a good while.

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:02.500
I trust you know why, correct?

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:03.370
Yes.

00:01:03.910 --> 00:01:06.780
And Nina, come to the 
staff room after class.

00:01:07.340 --> 00:01:08.500
That's everything.

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:09.580
Yes.

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:14.790
This is for you.

00:01:15.860 --> 00:01:17.750
It's from Bureau Chief Veronica.

00:01:17.750 --> 00:01:20.390
Apparently she wants to interview you 
once the graduation ceremony is over.

00:01:22.790 --> 00:01:27.030
It seems ALCA has determined your 
actions were quite an achievement.

00:01:27.030 --> 00:01:28.150
But that's...

00:01:33.080 --> 00:01:35.570
So I guess you're going to 
go back to ALCA after all?

00:01:35.570 --> 00:01:36.480
Fujisaki.

00:01:38.080 --> 00:01:39.370
I'm sorry.

00:01:39.370 --> 00:01:41.070
I shouldn't have jumped to conclusions.

00:01:41.070 --> 00:01:43.830
This is an important matter, so make 
sure you take time to think it over.

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:50.000
Episode 12

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:50.000
Good Fortune Will Come to Hinas Who Smile

00:01:50.960 --> 00:01:53.140
I declare a state of emergency!

00:01:54.260 --> 00:01:56.710
Mistress, you're shouting.

00:01:56.710 --> 00:01:57.680
But...

00:01:58.010 --> 00:02:01.230
Nina-san's going to join ALCA!

00:02:01.230 --> 00:02:05.510
Mistress, more accurately, 
she might be rejoining ALCA.

00:02:05.510 --> 00:02:06.770
She was an active member.

00:02:07.150 --> 00:02:08.890
But why?

00:02:08.890 --> 00:02:11.300
Judging from her conversation 
with the teachers,

00:02:11.300 --> 00:02:15.900
ALCA thought highly of Nina-san
saving Lion-san.

00:02:16.320 --> 00:02:19.500
I don't know the whole story 
on why Nina came to our school,

00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:21.910
but if you think about it, wouldn't 
this normally be considered good news?

00:02:22.480 --> 00:02:25.410
Indeed. You're right.

00:02:25.410 --> 00:02:28.800
It is certainly good tidings.

00:02:28.800 --> 00:02:31.580
But it's all just too sudden!

00:02:32.050 --> 00:02:33.700
You're right.

00:02:33.700 --> 00:02:35.360
If Nina-san gives the okay,

00:02:35.360 --> 00:02:37.300
who knows if we can
stay with her 'til graduation.

00:02:37.620 --> 00:02:40.570
What? That's so sad!

00:02:40.570 --> 00:02:41.570
I agree.

00:02:41.570 --> 00:02:42.850
As do I!

00:02:42.850 --> 00:02:44.470
Me too.

00:02:49.170 --> 00:02:50.520
I'm happy for her.

00:02:50.890 --> 00:02:52.350
Lion-san?

00:02:53.040 --> 00:02:54.380
This is great!

00:02:54.380 --> 00:02:57.140
I'm sure Nina-chan's overjoyed!

00:02:58.610 --> 00:03:01.760
Yup. Great. Good news.

00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:06.160
You okay?

00:03:06.870 --> 00:03:08.340
I'm fine.

00:03:12.010 --> 00:03:14.540
Now I'm more worried about Lion.

00:03:14.540 --> 00:03:17.140
She loves Nina, after all.

00:03:17.140 --> 00:03:20.730
I wonder if Nina-san has any 
intention of staying at our school.

00:03:20.730 --> 00:03:22.180
I dunno?

00:03:22.740 --> 00:03:27.520
Of course, if Nina-san wants to return 
to ALCA, then it's out of our hands.

00:03:27.520 --> 00:03:29.830
But if we can make feel that 
she'd like to stay here,

00:03:29.830 --> 00:03:32.440
and that she'd be better off here?

00:03:32.860 --> 00:03:36.940
Well, if she wanted to stay here, 
I'd be happier that way too.

00:03:36.940 --> 00:03:38.070
Right?

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:39.720
Mistress, let's do it.

00:03:39.720 --> 00:03:41.250
Yeah!

00:03:41.250 --> 00:03:44.690
Yeah, I think that's gonna be rough.

00:03:59.160 --> 00:04:02.090
Goodness gracious, what's the matter, Lion-chan?

00:04:03.770 --> 00:04:06.400
Yuko-senpai, are you getting ready to move?

00:04:06.400 --> 00:04:07.500
Yes.

00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:10.530
Once I graduate, I have to move 
out of the dorms, after all.

00:04:10.530 --> 00:04:12.410
Better to pack while I can.

00:04:12.410 --> 00:04:13.560
Oh.

00:04:13.820 --> 00:04:17.060
It's sad knowing we won't be 
together any longer, isn't it?

00:04:17.720 --> 00:04:18.940
You think so too, Yuko-senpai?

00:04:19.730 --> 00:04:20.820
Of course.

00:04:21.230 --> 00:04:25.320
But you've got Lion-chan, Nina-chan and 
Yayoi-chan by your side, don't you?

00:04:27.300 --> 00:04:28.790
And Belle-chan.

00:04:30.840 --> 00:04:31.780
Yeah!

00:04:34.100 --> 00:04:35.210
So I'll be fine!

00:04:35.560 --> 00:04:37.600
Thanks, Yuko-senpai.

00:04:38.760 --> 00:04:40.240
Goodness gracious.

00:04:45.860 --> 00:04:49.080
The food here really is delicious!

00:04:49.080 --> 00:04:50.010
It sure is!

00:04:50.320 --> 00:04:52.730
And all the ingredients are 
fresh-picked from Pirari Town.

00:04:53.130 --> 00:04:56.980
Eating food this good every day 
is the definition of happiness!

00:04:56.980 --> 00:04:58.290
Right, Nina?

00:04:58.290 --> 00:05:01.380
Huh? Y-Yeah.

00:05:01.380 --> 00:05:03.440
Considering all we have here,

00:05:03.440 --> 00:05:07.000
I guess we can bet you wouldn't 
find this at, say, ALCA.

00:05:12.230 --> 00:05:14.620
And Yuko-senpai's sweets are amazing.

00:05:14.620 --> 00:05:17.520
Shirakaba Dormitory is just the best!

00:05:17.520 --> 00:05:19.750
I'm happy to hear you say that.

00:05:19.750 --> 00:05:20.820
Karen!

00:05:21.480 --> 00:05:23.500
We won't be able to eat her sweets anymore.

00:05:23.500 --> 00:05:26.510
Oh! That's right, she's graduating.

00:05:26.510 --> 00:05:30.850
I am. But I'll make you 
plenty of treats until then!

00:05:30.850 --> 00:05:32.210
Yay!

00:05:32.210 --> 00:05:33.600
Thanks!

00:05:34.260 --> 00:05:38.930
When I learned I'd be the dorm head 
and look after you all for a year,

00:05:38.930 --> 00:05:41.610
I was worried if I'd be up to the task.

00:05:42.450 --> 00:05:45.940
But you're all such good girls, 
and I had a lot of fun.

00:05:46.430 --> 00:05:47.650
Thank you.

00:05:47.650 --> 00:05:49.200
Yuko-senpai.

00:05:49.730 --> 00:05:52.320
The graduation ceremony's the 
day after tomorrow, huh?

00:05:52.890 --> 00:05:54.540
It's so soon.

00:05:55.090 --> 00:05:56.520
The day after tomorrow...

00:05:57.170 --> 00:05:59.080
It'll be sad to go our separate ways,

00:05:59.080 --> 00:06:00.800
but there's nothing we can do about it.

00:06:00.800 --> 00:06:02.540
Yeah. You're right.

00:06:05.460 --> 00:06:08.260
Plan "Take Her by The Stomach" failed.

00:06:08.260 --> 00:06:12.810
That "it'll be sad to go our separate ways" 
line was totally about her own circumstances.

00:06:13.260 --> 00:06:15.060
It was sharp of you to notice that.

00:06:15.060 --> 00:06:18.070
Well, observing people is my specialty.

00:06:18.070 --> 00:06:19.620
That's my sister for you!

00:06:19.620 --> 00:06:21.900
Now then, it's time to carry out our next plan.

00:06:22.750 --> 00:06:24.210
What are these for?

00:06:24.210 --> 00:06:28.450
Our enjoyable memories together with 
Nina-san are sure to move her heart.

00:06:37.660 --> 00:06:40.010
I need to tell Yuko-senpai.

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:43.170
Oh, it's a picture of Nina-chan!

00:06:45.260 --> 00:06:46.930
This one's of Nina-chan, too.

00:06:46.930 --> 00:06:48.410
And this one!

00:06:49.650 --> 00:06:52.220
Nina-chan! It's Nina-chan!

00:06:53.520 --> 00:06:55.310
Lots of Nina-chan.

00:06:55.310 --> 00:06:58.870
Plan "Memories are Eternal" has failed.

00:06:59.450 --> 00:07:01.920
Mahiro-san, do you have any ideas?

00:07:01.920 --> 00:07:03.150
Won't say I don't.

00:07:05.120 --> 00:07:07.590
Mr. Fishing-With-A-Pole, go!

00:07:12.930 --> 00:07:14.200
What?

00:07:15.310 --> 00:07:17.010
What's going on?

00:07:17.010 --> 00:07:18.250
Goodness gracious.

00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:23.010
Tough luck. I failed.

00:07:34.260 --> 00:07:35.480
The water's nice, isn't it?

00:07:35.480 --> 00:07:36.470
Yeah.

00:07:37.810 --> 00:07:40.510
Mahiro-chan and Yayoi-chan sure are late.

00:07:40.510 --> 00:07:41.810
Now that you mention it...

00:07:41.810 --> 00:07:45.020
Goodness gracious, I wonder 
what could have happened?

00:07:46.370 --> 00:07:50.660
Gosh, you're always, always, always 
making these strange devices.

00:07:52.070 --> 00:07:54.450
Don't think you can just laugh this off.

00:07:54.450 --> 00:07:57.200
Mahiro-san, you're not 
really into this, are you?

00:07:57.200 --> 00:07:59.100
So you figured me out.

00:07:59.100 --> 00:08:00.740
Why aren't you?

00:08:03.090 --> 00:08:06.880
If going back to ALCA leads 
Nina to fulfilling her dream,

00:08:06.880 --> 00:08:08.300
I think it's wrong of us to get in her way.

00:08:08.800 --> 00:08:11.220
I already know that much.

00:08:13.240 --> 00:08:16.600
That's why we're doing things 
in such a roundabout way.

00:08:18.970 --> 00:08:21.140
If I knew it was clearly the right thing,

00:08:21.140 --> 00:08:23.450
I'd do everything in my power to stop her.

00:08:24.310 --> 00:08:28.560
And on top of that, I've still 
never once beaten Nina-san.

00:08:28.560 --> 00:08:32.240
I had planned to settle things 
in the winter practical exams.

00:08:32.770 --> 00:08:34.740
In that case...

00:08:41.200 --> 00:08:42.310
Come in.

00:08:44.900 --> 00:08:46.800
Let's look at these together.

00:08:46.800 --> 00:08:48.540
There's lots of shots of you!

00:08:49.330 --> 00:08:51.550
So those pictures belong to you?

00:08:51.550 --> 00:08:53.820
Nope. I found them on the floor.

00:08:53.820 --> 00:08:55.570
I wonder who they belong to.

00:08:55.570 --> 00:08:58.800
I tried looking, but everyone 
said they didn't know.

00:08:58.800 --> 00:09:00.420
Do you think it's bad if I keep them?

00:09:00.420 --> 00:09:02.350
If nobody knows who they belong to,

00:09:02.350 --> 00:09:04.180
then how about you hold on to them for now?

00:09:04.180 --> 00:09:05.770
Sounds good!

00:09:10.340 --> 00:09:12.690
The Pirari Festival was fun, wasn't it?

00:09:12.690 --> 00:09:13.650
Yeah.

00:09:13.650 --> 00:09:17.030
I should have nominated you 
for the Miss Pirari Contest.

00:09:17.030 --> 00:09:18.920
There's no need for that.

00:09:18.920 --> 00:09:20.220
Why not?

00:09:20.220 --> 00:09:21.510
Because there's no way.

00:09:21.510 --> 00:09:22.950
Why?

00:09:22.950 --> 00:09:25.180
When I say there's no way, 
I mean there's no way.

00:09:29.730 --> 00:09:32.380
The cherry blossoms were 
pretty, weren't they?

00:09:33.080 --> 00:09:35.170
Nina-chan, do you like cherry blossoms?

00:09:35.170 --> 00:09:36.410
I do.

00:09:36.410 --> 00:09:39.040
The tree we saw when we went 
cherry blossom viewing was pretty.

00:09:39.420 --> 00:09:41.760
The school has a path
lined with cherry blossom trees, right?

00:09:41.990 --> 00:09:45.890
When they're in full bloom, 
they're really pretty.

00:09:45.890 --> 00:09:47.020
Yeah?

00:09:49.830 --> 00:09:52.280
Oh, you haven't gotten a 
chance to see them, have you?

00:09:52.280 --> 00:09:53.140
No.

00:09:53.680 --> 00:09:57.690
I was really surprised when I found 
you passed out on the roadside.

00:09:58.840 --> 00:10:00.890
I was surprised, too.

00:10:00.890 --> 00:10:03.620
Because you were there, Nina-chan.

00:10:09.890 --> 00:10:11.140
Morning.

00:10:11.140 --> 00:10:13.480
Morning.

00:10:11.140 --> 00:10:13.480
Good morning to you.

00:10:16.180 --> 00:10:18.500
Isn't this a rare sight.

00:10:18.500 --> 00:10:20.810
You never get up on your own.

00:10:20.810 --> 00:10:23.350
'Cause I wanna give today my all.

00:10:38.260 --> 00:10:40.160
Our mistress is one thing.

00:10:40.160 --> 00:10:42.530
But losing to Ma-chan?!

00:10:43.730 --> 00:10:45.330
So you made it.

00:10:45.330 --> 00:10:46.700
We're in the preliminary rounds now.

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:49.040
Letter of 
Challenge

00:10:47.740 --> 00:10:49.040
Are you serious about this?

00:10:49.440 --> 00:10:51.220
Of course.

00:10:51.220 --> 00:10:55.100
Whoever wins gets to
challenge you.

00:10:55.100 --> 00:10:57.170
You can both come at me at once.

00:10:59.250 --> 00:11:02.340
Gate Access. Tetra-Heaven!

00:11:06.340 --> 00:11:07.970
They're strong, Michael.

00:11:08.910 --> 00:11:12.630
<i>Yes. I'll take them on as a knight.</i>

00:11:25.370 --> 00:11:27.830
But don't think you can beat me.

00:11:28.390 --> 00:11:30.020
Understood.

00:11:30.020 --> 00:11:30.870
Okay.

00:11:38.630 --> 00:11:40.800
<i>In any case, this is rather sudden.</i>

00:11:41.520 --> 00:11:45.050
I'm not at all satisfied with the 
results from our summer practical exam!

00:11:46.760 --> 00:11:49.310
It's 'cause you're the strongest one here!

00:11:49.980 --> 00:11:52.060
Let's do this, Nina!

00:12:09.190 --> 00:12:11.420
I'm not the strongest.

00:12:11.420 --> 00:12:13.960
Didn't I lose to Lion back then?

00:12:14.330 --> 00:12:17.040
I can challenge Lion-san at any time.

00:12:24.270 --> 00:12:27.600
But now's our last chance 
to settle things with you!

00:12:31.980 --> 00:12:33.810
You can't win and run away without a word!

00:12:33.810 --> 00:12:35.440
I'll never let you!

00:12:40.710 --> 00:12:42.150
What are you talking about?

00:12:43.940 --> 00:12:45.860
Take this seriously, Nina!

00:12:48.030 --> 00:12:49.530
Logic Drive!

00:13:05.510 --> 00:13:06.720
Nina-chan.

00:13:07.120 --> 00:13:09.220
I knew you'd be here.

00:13:09.610 --> 00:13:10.410
Yeah.

00:13:12.030 --> 00:13:13.730
It's so pretty.

00:13:13.730 --> 00:13:16.980
Soon we won't be able to see Orion anymore.

00:13:18.610 --> 00:13:19.800
So tomorrow's the day.

00:13:20.960 --> 00:13:22.390
The graduation ceremony.

00:13:22.890 --> 00:13:25.430
Yeah. That's right.

00:13:30.020 --> 00:13:31.240
Nina-chan?

00:13:32.690 --> 00:13:34.670
No, its nothing.

00:13:38.250 --> 00:13:41.170
Congratulations 
Pirari Academy Graduation Ceremony

00:13:41.170 --> 00:13:45.670
Congratulations Pirari Academy Graduation Diploma Awarding Ceremony

00:14:22.440 --> 00:14:25.570
Yuko-senpai, congratulations on graduating!

00:14:25.570 --> 00:14:26.800
Congrats!

00:14:27.300 --> 00:14:29.180
Thank you, everyone.

00:14:32.520 --> 00:14:34.860
Congratulations on graduation.

00:14:34.860 --> 00:14:36.180
Thanks, Ashley.

00:14:36.510 --> 00:14:38.560
When I first met you,

00:14:38.560 --> 00:14:41.940
I never thought we'd end up this way.

00:14:42.180 --> 00:14:43.680
Yeah.

00:14:43.680 --> 00:14:46.680
We were taken on lots of twists and 
turns by a certain person, but still...

00:14:51.240 --> 00:14:54.370
Tears don't suit a lovely lady like yourself.

00:14:55.370 --> 00:14:58.660
Gosh, Mizuki-senpai, you're so funny!

00:15:00.140 --> 00:15:02.500
But it was fun.

00:15:02.500 --> 00:15:03.380
Yeah.

00:15:12.370 --> 00:15:14.260
Now then, shall we?

00:15:14.260 --> 00:15:14.980
Yup.

00:15:15.970 --> 00:15:17.720
Excuse me, but are you two...

00:15:20.100 --> 00:15:24.130
I've been assigned to the 
same ALCA office as Mizuki.

00:15:24.130 --> 00:15:25.700
What a handful.

00:15:27.010 --> 00:15:29.110
Take care, everyone.

00:15:29.110 --> 00:15:31.580
Wait a second. I'm a handful?

00:15:31.580 --> 00:15:33.290
Don't tell me you don't like me?

00:15:33.290 --> 00:15:36.020
Now that I think about it, where's Lion-chan?

00:15:33.730 --> 00:15:36.870
Yuko. Yuko!

00:16:02.580 --> 00:16:03.810
Nina-san!

00:16:22.010 --> 00:16:23.460
Alexandrovna-san?

00:16:39.570 --> 00:16:40.810
Lion?

00:16:46.500 --> 00:16:47.790
Lion!

00:16:47.790 --> 00:16:49.440
Nina-chan.

00:16:52.300 --> 00:16:54.660
Why did you do this with the cherry blossoms?

00:16:56.100 --> 00:16:57.820
I wanted to show them to you.

00:16:57.820 --> 00:17:00.160
Because you said you liked them.

00:17:01.120 --> 00:17:03.830
I wanted you to see them one last time.

00:17:04.930 --> 00:17:07.330
Because we're parting ways?

00:17:08.720 --> 00:17:09.590
Yeah.

00:17:10.290 --> 00:17:12.730
Because I'm going back to ALCA?

00:17:13.460 --> 00:17:14.220
Yeah.

00:17:17.120 --> 00:17:21.720
You knew how I felt from 
the beginning, right?

00:17:23.940 --> 00:17:25.230
I'm sorry.

00:17:25.680 --> 00:17:27.870
No, I'm fine!

00:17:27.870 --> 00:17:32.320
After all, I promised I'd 
be here to cheer you on.

00:17:32.880 --> 00:17:35.280
Besides, I'll catch up to you in no time.

00:17:35.600 --> 00:17:38.170
Well... Maybe no time is impossible.

00:17:38.170 --> 00:17:39.660
In five years?

00:17:39.660 --> 00:17:41.990
I guess it's actually 
gonna take me a long time.

00:17:42.350 --> 00:17:44.000
But still, I'll definitely get there!

00:17:47.340 --> 00:17:49.960
Really, you're just...

00:17:53.190 --> 00:17:56.690
No, I guess I should say 
you and everyone else here.

00:17:59.280 --> 00:18:01.490
How could I possibly leave?

00:18:01.490 --> 00:18:03.640
All of my precious friends are here.

00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:27.880
She's done it again.

00:18:28.880 --> 00:18:30.140
Hi there, Belle.

00:18:30.140 --> 00:18:32.500
What happened to your job 
of watching over her?

00:18:36.400 --> 00:18:38.630
So we're gonna be in charge 
of those kids again next year?

00:18:39.760 --> 00:18:41.410
Lots to look forward to.

00:18:41.410 --> 00:18:42.660
You said it.

00:18:48.240 --> 00:18:52.080
Yes. This world is fun, isn't it?

00:18:55.910 --> 00:18:59.200
Everything in this world 
is constantly in flux,

00:18:59.200 --> 00:19:01.160
unaware of how to stop.

00:19:02.990 --> 00:19:07.660
Yes. Like a song coming 
together, full of life.

00:19:15.330 --> 00:19:18.880
It's the first time I've seen cherry 
blossoms at a graduation ceremony.

00:19:18.880 --> 00:19:19.670
Yes.

00:19:20.320 --> 00:19:22.840
What's going to happen during 
the entrance ceremony?

00:19:22.840 --> 00:19:27.300
More flowers will be here 
to greet all the new chicks.

00:19:29.520 --> 00:19:31.850
Yuko-senpai, take care.

00:19:32.450 --> 00:19:34.730
Are you all better now, Lion-chan?

00:19:35.170 --> 00:19:36.020
Yup!

00:19:56.370 --> 00:19:58.210
I'm your precious friend.

00:19:58.800 --> 00:20:02.080
In case you forgot, I meant 
everyone when I said that.

00:20:02.080 --> 00:20:03.640
I know that.

00:20:04.980 --> 00:20:06.850
Can I ask you something?

00:20:07.520 --> 00:20:08.600
What?

00:20:09.160 --> 00:20:12.180
What kind of Logicalist do you want to be?

00:20:12.910 --> 00:20:14.600
One like you.

00:20:14.990 --> 00:20:17.240
I want something more concrete.

00:20:17.240 --> 00:20:18.660
Let's see.

00:20:18.660 --> 00:20:20.830
I want to help people in need,

00:20:20.830 --> 00:20:23.870
and cheer people on who 
are trying their best.

00:20:23.870 --> 00:20:26.410
Just like you did for me!

00:20:28.980 --> 00:20:30.360
How about you?

00:20:30.960 --> 00:20:33.200
The same kind as I am now.

00:20:33.200 --> 00:20:37.420
I want to protect the world with 
the powers I've been given.

00:20:37.660 --> 00:20:40.670
So I'm going to study all sorts of 
different things at this school,

00:20:41.040 --> 00:20:42.360
and get stronger.

00:20:43.140 --> 00:20:44.430
Like you.

00:20:44.660 --> 00:20:47.190
Huh? What was that last part?

00:20:47.190 --> 00:20:48.450
Nothing.

00:20:49.440 --> 00:20:52.290
Nina-chan! Tell me!

00:20:58.840 --> 00:21:00.570
What's everyone doing here?

00:21:02.700 --> 00:21:04.370
We've been waiting.

00:21:04.370 --> 00:21:07.680
On the off chance you change your mind.

00:21:09.300 --> 00:21:12.880
Didn't I tell you that I plan 
on staying here yesterday?

00:21:14.610 --> 00:21:16.840
Are you really okay with that?

00:21:17.870 --> 00:21:22.050
Yes. There's something I need to learn here.

00:21:24.210 --> 00:21:25.630
And we're all here!

00:21:28.380 --> 00:21:30.140
What do you mean by that?

00:21:30.640 --> 00:21:31.700
Well, you see...

00:21:33.570 --> 00:21:35.770
She said we're all her precious friends.

00:21:37.440 --> 00:21:38.330
Nina-san!

00:21:38.330 --> 00:21:38.980
Nina!

00:21:38.980 --> 00:21:39.970
Nina-sama!

00:21:39.970 --> 00:21:40.900
Yay!

00:21:41.380 --> 00:21:42.400
Wait a second, guys!

00:21:42.660 --> 00:21:44.180
I'm just so touched!

00:21:44.180 --> 00:21:45.400
This is what I call friendship!

00:21:45.400 --> 00:21:46.930
Nina-san, you're the best.

00:21:46.000 --> 00:21:48.360
Um? I'm...

00:21:46.930 --> 00:21:49.320
Don't leave me out!

00:21:49.320 --> 00:21:52.240
Nina-chan! I love you!

00:23:30.020 --> 00:23:32.470
Lion-san.

00:23:32.910 --> 00:23:34.070
Gosh.

00:23:36.220 --> 00:23:39.930
The End
